id: pmc-38z4
title: Certify pm-changelog on PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.4 and consolidate pending dependency updates
description: "Refresh the development PM CLI SDK and pm-ops toolchain to the current published versions, retain a fail-closed merge-driver prepare hook, and validate the release and real install paths."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[4]: agent-readiness,release,sdk,toolchain
created_at: "2026-09-26T21:50:50.783Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T11:23:07.043Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "package manifest and lockfile resolve PM CLI 2026.9.26 and pm-ops 2026.9.28; release gate, strict PM health, and isolated npm and Bun package smoke checks pass with measured coverage; PR links this item and exact-head checks and bot reviews are recorded separately; merge-driver launcher matches the published pm-ops template and the ancestor-install fix from pm-ops PR 124 is adopted through pm-ops 2026.9.28"
actual_result: "PM CLI/SDK and pm-ops 2026.10.4 exact pins; Dependabot #214/#216/#217/#218 consolidated. Full locked npm run release:check PASS: 527/527 tests, zero skipped, 100% measured lines/branches/functions across 12 sources, 158 documented declarations; audit:prod, pack:dry-run, changelog:check, release-date and publish-attestation all green. npm audit and npm audit --omit=dev both zero vulnerabilities; alerts []. Packed real-tracker dogfood via npm npx and native Bun bunx generate/export PASS: 160 closed items, Markdown 12602 bytes and JSON byte-identical; scratch deleted. Managed pm-github 2026.10.4 dry-run preview: 0 synced/0 skipped/0 planned (zero-case, no provenance-linked items). npx pm health PASS with unchanged legacy role-domain warning count 32. Independent statements remain unmeasured in pmc-ilrh. Final-head CI and substantive reviews remain separate; orchestrator owns merging and closure."
comments[13]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T06:31:45.703Z",claude-hub,"2026-09-28: pinned pm-ops 2026.9.28 and re-copied its templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts in f3d0c55 (pm-ops#124: the omit-dev skip now checks every Node resolution path for an incomplete hoisted pm-ops). release:check and changelog:check pass on this branch. Acceptance criteria updated from pm-ops 2026.9.26 to 2026.9.28 after the claim takeover."
  "2026-10-02T22:09:23.594Z",codex-sol,"Restart by codex-sol: retained head 440b9e6 is pushed and clean. Existing bot replies and resolutions preserved. Revalidating release:check plus the exact CI legacy provenance baseline. Published pm-ops 2026.9.28 is already adopted; the stale PR description will be aligned with that state. Statement metric gap stays in pmc-ilrh; canonical probe robustness stays in pm-ops#135."
  "2026-10-02T22:14:49.209Z",codex-sol,"Restart full gate exposed one existing fixture failure (523/524): missing-package test assumed shared tmpdir ancestors contained no package.json, but host /tmp/package.json exists. Replaced the temporary-directory assumption with a real filesystem-root missing-file fixture and an explicit absence assertion; same missing-package exception is required. Scoped test passes. Initial launcher linked test failed before npm ci due missing dependencies, then passed 7/7 after install. Exact CI provenance baseline (32 events) passes unchanged. Re-running full release gate after the fixture correction."
  "2026-10-02T22:38:09.306Z",codex-sol,"Full retry passed 524/524 tests but the unchanged 100% gate correctly failed at 99.97% lines/99.94% branches: moving the missing-package fixture to filesystem root left the upward-search assignments unexercised. Extended the existing positive version test with a nested/child cwd that resolves its real parent package.json. Both focused cases pass; no thresholds or coverage scope changed. Running full release:check again."
  "2026-10-02T22:57:21.558Z",codex-sol,"npm ci and npm run release:check PASS: 524/524 tests, zero skipped, 100% measured lines/branches/functions across 12 sources, 158 documented declarations, audit/pack/changelog/date/attestation green. Exact unchanged CI health provenance baseline passes. Linked launcher tests pass 7/7 and focused missing-package test passes. Existing positive version test now verifies ancestor lookup; missing-package fixture explicitly checks filesystem-root absence. Independent statements remain unmeasured in open pmc-ilrh. History prefixes are preserved. Final-head CI and bot receipts remain separate; item stays in_progress and is released, never closed."
  "2026-10-04T08:44:41.353Z",pi-glm,"Greptile P1 + cubic P2 findings (PR 215 third-round, unresolved): the missing-package fixture still depended on host metadata — first on a clean shared tmpdir, then on the filesystem root, and a relative TMPDIR made parse(tmpdir()).root empty and could select the checkout's own package.json. Fixed test-first: resolveReleaseContext gains an optional packageSearchBoundary (inclusive stop for the upward package.json search; a non-ancestor boundary fails closed with RangeError instead of silently walking to /), and the missing-package test now builds a fixture it owns (resolved tmpdir, so a relative TMPDIR anchors correctly), plants a decoy package.json directly ABOVE the boundary, and requires the same missing-package error from a path inside the boundary with no package.json anywhere up to it — deterministic on every host, including one where /tmp/package.json or /package.json exists. The red test failed against e20220f (found the decoy, no throw) and passes after the fix. Boundary-inclusive and invalid-boundary regression tests added."
  "2026-10-04T08:44:48.697Z",pi-glm,"Restart validation (pi-glm): npm ci and npm run release:check PASS — 526/526 tests, zero skipped; 100% measured lines/branches/functions across all 12 sources; 158 documented declarations; audit:prod, pack, changelog:check, release-changelog-date and publish-attestation green. Scoped linked tests pass: focused missing-package fixture 1/1 and prepare-merge-driver launcher suite 7/7; both also pass with a relative TMPDIR (TMPDIR=reltmp). No production API changed: packageSearchBoundary is a new optional ReleaseContextOptions field with the historical default (filesystem root of the resolved cwd) byte-compatible for existing callers."
  "2026-10-04T10:49:38.002Z",codex-sol,"Isolated worktree certification by codex-sol: consolidate Dependabot #214/#216/#217/#218, exact published dev pins, canonical launcher, full CI gate, packed real-tracker npm/Bun dogfood and read-only GitHub preview. No merge or publication; item remains open for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-04T10:56:40.032Z",codex-sol,"Published pins: CLI/SDK and pm-ops 2026.10.4; @types/node 26.6.4; TypeScript 7.0.2; parser alias npm:typescript@5.9.3 retained on its required API major with exact pin. Security alert query returned []; npm audit and npm audit --omit=dev both found zero vulnerabilities. Installed managed pm-github 2026.10.4; github sync --repo unbraind/pm-changelog --dry-run reports no provenance-linked items and synced=0/skipped=0/planned=0 (zero-case preview). Independent statement metric remains tracked by pmc-ilrh."
  "2026-10-04T10:59:13.574Z",codex-sol,"Linked launcher run through pm test --run --only-last --progress --pm-context schema --override-linked-pm-context passed 7/7 tests with zero skips. The initial inherited receipt was untrusted on this branch, so tests were acknowledged; an attempted none/source context was correctly refused, then schema/source executed successfully. Full release gate runs directly under flock and its observed result will be recorded explicitly."
  "2026-10-04T11:06:14.106Z",codex-sol,"Initial full gate: 524/526 passed, zero skipped; two end-to-end fixtures failed because CLI 2026.10.4 correctly refuses incomplete local-source scans at 10000 entries. Updated those fixtures to install npm packed distributions while preserving activation/doctor/output assertions. Canonical pm-ops template also adds a filesystem-error refusal branch: adding a real NODE_PATH file/ENOTDIR fixture to cover it; no template edits or threshold changes. Real tracker dogfood passed npm and native Bun: 160 closed items; Markdown 12602 bytes and JSON byte-identical; scratch removed."
  "2026-10-04T11:16:28.952Z",codex-sol,"Focused real acceptance passed 3/3 with zero skips: both packed installation/CLI activation fixtures plus real malformed global lookup path. Rerunning full release gate without changing thresholds."
  "2026-10-04T11:23:06.049Z",codex-sol,"Full gate green: 527/527, zero skips, 100% measured lines/branches/functions, 12 sources; linked final launcher suite passed 8/8. Evidence in docs/certification-2026.10.4.md. Releasing claim for orchestrator while leaving item in_progress and open; CI/reviews are evaluated separately at the pushed PR head."
notes[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-26T21:52:49.477Z",codex,Full release gate failed on template byte-identity after copying the unmerged pm-ops PR 124 launcher. Switched to published pm-ops 2026.9.26 template; ancestor-install fix remains upstream.
  "2026-09-26T21:56:33.395Z",codex,"Local npm run release:check passed: 523/523 tests, 0 skips, 100% lines/branches/functions over 12 reported sources, 158/158 documented declarations, and 0 production audit vulnerabilities. Statement coverage is not independently measured; see open pmc-ilrh."
  "2026-09-26T21:56:33.395Z",codex,"Packed candidate installed in isolated npm and Bun 1.3.5 workspaces with PM CLI 2026.9.26. Each initialized a tracker, created and closed a real task, generated CHANGELOG.md containing that task, and Bun also executed the package CLI directly. Temporary workspaces removed."
  "2026-09-26T21:56:33.395Z",codex,Strict PM health ok with pre-existing provenance_value_domain_invalid advisory. Published pm-ops 2026.9.26 template matches byte-for-byte; ancestor lookup fix is pending unmerged pm-ops PR 124.
  "2026-09-26T22:08:45.161Z",codex,"Greptile PR 215 discussion_r4112946837 identified missing coverage for the published launcher broken-install branch. Added real child-checkout fixtures for both an incomplete local pm-ops directory and a dangling link; each fails closed with MODULE_NOT_FOUND and registers no Git driver. Targeted test passed 7/7. Full release gate rerun passed 524/524 tests, 0 skips, 100% reported lines branches functions, 158 documented declarations, and 0 production audit vulnerabilities. Statement coverage remains independently unmeasured."
